      "text": "Verified reuse, not a claimed live rebuild\nWorking connection / toolbox v2 reused; repeated isolated Terraform plan had no changes.\nIsolated agent v1 + publication work in Copilot. Fresh creation, rotation and teardown: offline-tested, not live-replayed.\nBuilds, resources, grants, network changes, publication and model calls require owner approval.",
